      en: ["The park spans a total area of approximately 10,000 hectares", "It was officially designated as a national park in 2002", "There are 21 villages located within the park's boundaries", "The area contains several 'hunebedden' (megalithic tombs) from the Neolithic era", "The Drentsche Aa river system has a total length of about 50 kilometers", "Over 50% of the park's land is still used for active agriculture"],
