      en: ["The national park covers an area of approximately 10,500 hectares.", "The separate areas of Weerribben and Wieden were merged in 2009.", "The European otter was reintroduced here in 2002 after decades of absence.", "Local farmers still harvest reeds from 3,000 hectares for traditional roofing.", "The park contains the largest floating fen-mire in Northwestern Europe.", "Water dominates the park, with canals covering about 1,000 hectares."],
